  "content": "<div style=\"display:flex\">\n<div><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/載具Forge-ecebe6?labelColor=51dcc7&amp;style=for-the-badge\" width=\"130\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/可用1.20.1-ecebe6?labelColor=51dcc7&amp;style=for-the-badge\" width=\"146\" height=\"26\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/TRzEdrndM2\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1104430139275743293.svg?label=&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=ffffff&amp;color=7389D8&amp;labelColor=6A7EC2&amp;style=for-the-badge\" width=\"129\" height=\"26\"></a><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Iron431\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://shields.io/badge/-Patreon-f86754?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=patreon&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"99\" height=\"26\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbmc.link%252firon431\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://shields.io/badge/-請我喝杯咖啡FFDD00?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=buymeacoffee&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"152\" height=\"26\"></a></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Allthemodium Compat 擴充模組：Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks</span></h2><p style=\"text-align:center\">需要安裝 <a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/irons-spells-n-spellbooks\" rel=\"nofollow\">Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks</a> 才能運作</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">需要安裝 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/allthemodium\" rel=\"nofollow\">Allthemodium</a> 以解鎖配方（可選）</p><hr><ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\">新增 Allthemodium、Vibranium 與 Unobtainium 的法師護甲及法術書</li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\">可自訂屬性和能力</li>\n</ul><hr><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/747/823/2023-10-24_12.png\" width=\"1126\" height=\"602\"></p>",
